<title>USA: America Online offers refund in settlement.</title>
<headline>America Online offers refund in settlement.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>America Online Co. agreed in principle to refund to frustrated customers up to two months worth of the costs of the online service, the Illinois Attorney General said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposed settlement with the largest online service will avoid a consumer fraud suit threatened by attorneys general in dozens of states.</p>
</text>
